msgstr "Connect your account under Integrations → Transkribus, then enable Critical text edition in Settings → Research modules. In that module choose a JPEG, PNG or TIFF page (up to 20 MB), search the public models by name, filter by language or material and select a model, approve the credit use and start recognition. The last job is saved on this device for status checks after returning. Review and correct the transcription, provide its source and rights, choose a manuscript section and insert it. Text and original PAGE XML can be downloaded. The password is not stored; access and refresh tokens are encrypted on the Studio API server. PDF files and collection synchronisation are not part of this workflow."

